{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122212","id":5098340348,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABL-J__A","number":122212,"title":"Game isn't properly in the embedded game window opened from editor","user":{"login":"Psychpsyo","id":60073468,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDczNDY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60073468?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo","html_url":"https://github.com/Psychpsyo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Psychpsyo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-08T16:15:38Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T19:20:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n`v4.7.1.stable.fedora [a13da4feb]`, although this has been an issue since 4.6 and probably earlier.\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Fedora 44 with KDE Plasma (wayland)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen starting the game by pressing play in the editor, it is put into a window with some controls at the top.\nBut it seems like the game itself isn't actually part of that window, leading to it not being visible in, for example the Alt+Tab preview of the window and the task bar popup for it:\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6fb7329-1a18-4c49-a4b4-2c734df000a9\" />\n\nIt also doesn't deform with window effects, like [wobbly windows](https://youtu.be/m4JX21Qucwo?t=14). This means that, while moving the window around, the superimposed rectangle that is the actual game pokes out of the deformed window frame:\n\n<img width=\"1369\" height=\"854\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32e8af25-5707-4ca4-a624-d4f0fd318936\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start game from editor.\n2. Look at task bar / Alt+Tab preview of the window or try moving it while having wobbly windows enabled\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis happens to brand new project files with nothing in them, such as this one:\n\n[BrandNewGodotWithNothing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30858785/BrandNewGodotWithNothing.zip)\n\n(although it helps to have at least something, like a Sprite2D in the project so to be able to tell that the task bar preview is empty)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122212/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}